@@ ============================================================
@@ EaΦf — eccentric anomaly by Kepler's equation (Root solver)
@@ Solves E = M + e·(180/π)·sin(E). Mode-independent (explicit _°).
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : e M   ( e M -- E )
@@ Output : eccentric anomaly (°)
@@ VALIDATION (device-confirmed):
@@   Component of PosΦf (device-confirmed in chain).
@@ ============================================================
 → eLΦ MLΦ
  « eLΦ Uval 'eLΦ' Sto  MLΦ Uval 'MLΦ' Sto
    'Root(EaLΦ=(MLΦ_°)+eLΦ·(180_°)/→Num(Ⓒπ)·sin(EaLΦ_°);EaLΦ;1_°)' Eval
  »
»
